### 新增课程评价
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "课程讲解清晰，示例很实用",
  "rating": 5
}

### 评价内容为空
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "",
  "rating": 5
}

### 评分超出范围
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "课程评价",
  "rating": 6
}

### 对不存在的课程提交评价
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses/999999/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "课程评价",
  "rating": 4
}

### 分页查询课程评价
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1/comments?page=1&size=10

### 使用默认分页参数
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1/comments

### 非法分页参数
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1/comments?page=0&size=101
